 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nBharat Components Pvt Ltd                                  MASTER SERVICES\n22 MG Road, 600001 Chennai, India                               AGREEMENT\nGSTIN: 32AAACG5658A1Z0\nReg No: IN-814048\n\nFROM                                                        BILL TO\nBharat Components Pvt Ltd                                  Ganga Pharma Ltd\n22 MG Road                                                  Plot 14, MIDC Industrial Area\n600001 Chennai                                              600001 Chennai\nIndia                                                       India\nVAT: 32AAACG5658A1Z0\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 21-02-2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Bharat Components Pvt Ltd, with its registered office at 22 MG Road, Chennai (\"Party A\"), and Ganga Pharma\nLtd, with its registered office at Plot 14, MIDC Industrial Area, Chennai (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Bharat Components Pvt Ltd / Priya Sharma\nParty B    Ganga Pharma Ltd / Rahul Verma\nDate       21-02-2026",
